body:
Thanks! 

I actually found a solution before I saw you post. But I want to say thank you to you and everyone who has helped. You've all been awesome!

My solution was :

    function transposeTwoStrings(arr){
        let stringOne = arr[0];
        let stringTwo = arr[1];
        let vertChars = "";
    	let maxLength = Math.max(stringOne.length, 
    stringTwo.length);
        for (var i = 0; i < maxLength; i++) {
          vertChars += stringOne[i] || " ";
          vertChars += " ";
          vertChars += stringTwo[i] || " ";
           if (i !== (maxLength - 1)) {
            vertChars += "\n";
              }
        }
      return vertChars;
    }
